<title>USA: New York grain freight fixtures - Nov 6.</title>
<headline>New York grain freight fixtures - Nov 6.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Themera 50,000 long tons soybeans 11-18/11 Mississippi/China $26.50 fio 10,000/4,000 Glencore.</p>
<p>TBN 20,000 long tons grains 10-20/11 Paranagua/Cont $13.75 fio seven days Acti.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk +1 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
